The app is built in `src/main.ts` (default-export `mount`), with `src/board.ts`, `src/archive.ts`, `src/dom.ts` and `src/styles.ts` alongside. `./check` passes and `./test` passes 26/26 visible tests (2 of 15 runs used). I'm unsure about hidden-test edge cases: I disable rather than hide move buttons that would reorder around a pending add or enter a column that is still loading, and I trim titles. The visible run also logged one 404 console error, which I did not trace; it is probably the favicon request, not app code.